on the cell phone.

19
00:04:48.363 --> 00:04:50.739
Are they still asking
for a change of venue?

20
00:04:50.824 --> 00:04:54.451
He's enhanceable
because of priors in the early '80s.

21
00:04:57.664 --> 00:05:00.666
