01:23:18.694 --> 01:23:20.736
No, no, no! Wait, wait!

949
01:23:51.977 --> 01:23:54.145
Hey, hey! Hold on. Hold on.
I'm Detective Fanning.

950
01:23:54.229 --> 01:23:55.312
I'm Max! I'm Max!

951
01:23:55.439 --> 01:23:57.648
I'm a goddamn cab driver, man!
I'm a goddamn cab driver.

952
01:23:57.733 --> 01:24:01.777
I know. I know. I'm getting you
out of here. I'm LAPD. Come on.

953
01:24:38.982 --> 01:24:40.775
- How'd you find me?
- You're okay. You're okay.

954
01:24:40.859 --> 01:24:43.027
Just move it. Keep moving.

955
01:24:51.995 --> 01:24:53.454
You're okay.

956
01:24:54.372 --> 01:24:57.458
- How'd you find me?
- You're okay. You're okay.

957
01:24:57.542 --> 01:24:59.960
You're okay. You're all right.

958
01:25:08.970 --> 01:25:10.346
Let's go!

959
01:25:12.891 --> 01:25:14.225
Let's go.

960
01:25:22.943 --> 01:25:24.693
Go! Drive! Drive!

961
01:26:02.566 --> 01:26:05.818
Only thing didn't show up
is the Polish cavalry.

962
01:26:06.778 --> 01:26:09.363
You're alive. I saved you.

963
01:26:12.617 --> 01:26:16.412
Do I get any thanks? No.
All you can do is clam up.

964
01:26:19.541 --> 01:26:22.293
You wanna talk?
Do you want me to fuck off?

965
01:26:22.377 --> 01:26:23.794
Fuck off.

966
01:26:26.590 --> 01:26:29.592
- You had to kill Fanning?
- Who the fuck is Fanning?

967
01:26:29.676 --> 01:26:31.427
Fanning, the cop.

968
01:26:33.138 --> 01:26:35.014
Why'd you have to kill him?

969
01:26:35.098 --> 01:26:38.350
He's probably got a family.
Kids are gonna grow up without him.

970
01:26:38.435 --> 01:26:40.352
He believed me.

971
01:26:40.437 --> 01:26:42.605
Oh, I should've saved him
because he believed you.

972
01:26:42.689 --> 01:26:44.440
- No, no. Not that.
- Yeah. That.

973
01:26:44.524 --> 01:26:46.066
Well, yeah, that.
What's wrong with that?

974
01:26:46.151 --> 01:26:48.611
- It's what I do for a living.
- Some living.

975
01:26:48.695 --> 01:26:50.905
- Head downtown.
- What's downtown?

976
01:26:50.989 --> 01:26:54.992
How are you at math?
I was hired for five hits. I did four.

977
01:26:57.037 --> 01:27:00.748
Why didn't you just kill me
and get another cab driver?

978
01:27:00.832 --> 01:27:03.292
Because you're good.
We're in this together.

979
01:27:03.376 --> 01:27:05.377
Fates intertwined.
Cosmic coincidence, you know.

980
01:27:05.462 --> 01:27:08.297
- Come on. You full of shit.
- All that crap. I'm full of shit?

981
01:27:08.381 --> 01:27:10.466
You're a monument of it.
You even bullshitted yourself.

982
01:27:10.550 --> 01:27:13.010
"All I am is taking out the garbage,
killing bad people."

983
01:27:13.094 --> 01:27:16.221
- Well, that's what you said.
- You believed me?

984
01:27:17.307 --> 01:27:20.351
- Then what'd they do?
- How do I know, you know?

985
01:27:20.435 --> 01:27:25.648
They all got that "witness for
the prosecution" look to me.

986
01:27:25.732 --> 01:27:27.816
Probably some major
federal indictment of somebody

987
01:27:27.901 --> 01:27:30.903
who majorly does not
wanna get indicted.

988
01:27:30.987 --> 01:27:33.113
So that's the reason?

989
01:27:33.615 --> 01:27:35.366
That's the why. There's no reason.

990
01:27:35.450 --> 01:27:39.244
There's no good reason,
there's no bad reason to live or to die.

991
01:27:39.329 --> 01:27:41.330
Then what are you?

992
01:27:41.414 --> 01:27:42.957
Indifferent.

993
01:27:45.794 --> 01:27:47.211
Get with it.

994
01:27:47.295 --> 01:27:49.546
Millions of galaxies
of hundreds of millions of stars

995
01:27:49.631 --> 01:27:52.216
and a speck on one in a blink.

996
01:27:52.759 --> 01:27:54.927
That's us. Lost in space.

997
01:27:55.011 --> 01:27:58.847
The cop, you, me, who notices?

998
01:28:08.108 --> 01:28:10.067
What's with you?

999
01:28:11.528 --> 01:28:13.195
As in?

1000
01:28:13.279 --> 01:28:15.781
As in, if somebody had a gun
to your head and said,

1001
01:28:15.865 --> 01:28:18.450
"You gotta tell me what's going on
with this person over here

1002
01:28:18.535 --> 01:28:20.577
"or I'm gonna kill you.

1003
01:28:22.288 --> 01:28:25.416
"What is driving him?
What was he thinking?"

1004
01:28:25.500 --> 01:28:26.709
You know, you couldn't do it, could you?

1005
01:28:26.793 --> 01:28:29.670
Because they would
have to kill your ass,

1006
01:28:29.754 --> 01:28:33.632
because you don't know
what anyone else is thinking.

1007
01:28:35.385 --> 01:28:38.637
I think you're low, my brother. Way low.

1008
01:28:39.806 --> 01:28:43.642
Like, what were you? One of those
institutionalized-raised guys?

1009
01:28:43.727 --> 01:28:45.644
Anybody home?

1010
01:28:45.729 --> 01:28:49.565
And... And the standard parts that
are supposed to be there in people,

1011
01:28:49.649 --> 01:28:52.401
in you, aren't.

1012
01:28:57.574 --> 01:29:00.200
And why haven't you killed me yet?

1013
01:29:03.371 --> 01:29:07.708
Of all the cabbies in L.A., I get Max,
Sigmund Freud meets Dr. Ruth.

1014
01:29:08.710 --> 01:29:10.669
Answer the question.

1015
01:29:12.922 --> 01:29:14.757
Look in the mirror.

1016
01:29:15.759 --> 01:29:18.427
Paper towels, clean cab,
limo company someday.

1017
01:29:18.511 --> 01:29:21.597
- How much you got saved?
- That ain't none of your business.

1018
01:29:21.681 --> 01:29:25.100
Someday?
"Someday my dream will come"?

1019
01:29:25.185 --> 01:29:28.437
One night you'll wake up,
and you'll discover it never happened.

1020
01:29:28.521 --> 01:29:32.858
It's all turned around on you.
It never will. Suddenly you are old.

1021
01:29:34.694 --> 01:29:35.778
Didn't happen.

1022
01:29:35.862 --> 01:29:38.906
And it never will, because you
were never gonna do it anyway.

1023
01:29:38.990 --> 01:29:42.117
You'll push it into memory,
then zone out in your Barcalounger,

1024
01:29:42.202 --> 01:29:46.622
being hypnotized by daytime TV
for the rest of your life.

1025
01:29:46.706 --> 01:29:48.707
Don't you talk to me about murder.

1026
01:29:48.792 --> 01:29:52.836
All it ever took was a down payment
on a Lincoln Town Car.

1027
01:29:52.921 --> 01:29:56.006
Or that girl. You can't even call that girl.

1028
01:29:56.758 --> 01:30:00.052
What the fuck are you still doing
driving a cab?

1029
01:30:18.279 --> 01:30:21.365
Because I never straightened up
and looked at it, you know?

1030
01:30:21.449 --> 01:30:24.451
Myself. I should have.

1031
01:30:26.287 --> 01:30:27.871
I've tried to gamble my way
out from under

1032
01:30:27.956 --> 01:30:31.083
but that was just a born-to-lose deal.

1033
01:30:31.167 --> 01:30:33.210
- Slow down.
- It's gotta be perfect.

1034
01:30:33.294 --> 01:30:36.964
It's got to be perfect to go.
Risk all torqued down.

1035
01:30:38.883 --> 01:30:41.760
I could've done it anytime I wanted to.

1036
01:30:41.845 --> 01:30:43.262
Red light.

1037
01:30:50.353 --> 01:30:52.563
But you know what? New news.

1038
01:30:52.647 --> 01:30:55.774
It doesn't matter anyway.
What does it matter anyway?

1039
01:30:55.859 --> 01:30:59.570
We're all insignificant out here
in this big-ass nowhere.

1040
01:30:59.654 --> 01:31:01.613
Twilight Zone shit.

1041
01:31:06.953 --> 01:31:09.913
Says the badass sociopath
in my back seat.

1042
01:31:14.127 --> 01:31:17.504
But you know what? That's the one thing
I gotta thank you for, bro.

1043
01:31:17.589 --> 01:31:20.924
Because until now,
I never looked at it that way.

1044
01:31:23.469 --> 01:31:26.889
What does it matter?
It don't, so fuck it. Fix it.

1045
01:31:27.432 --> 01:31:30.058
What do we got to lose anyway, right?

1046
01:31:30.143 --> 01:31:32.561
- Slow down.
- Why? You gonna shoot me?

1047
01:31:32.645 --> 01:31:34.146
You gonna pull the trigger and kill us?

1048
01:31:34.230 --> 01:31:36.106
- Go ahead, shoot my ass.
- Slow the hell down.

1049
01:31:36.191 --> 01:31:39.109
You gonna shoot me? You gonna
shoot me now? You gonna kill us?

1050
01:31:39.194 --> 01:31:41.945
Well, shoot my ass, then.
Huh? Shoot me.

1051
01:31:42.030 --> 01:31:44.156
- Slow down!
- You're right.

1052
01:31:45.450 --> 01:31:47.492
You know what, Vincent?

1053
01:31:48.077 --> 01:31:49.912
Go fuck yourself!

1054
01:32:22.362 --> 01:32:26.198
- Well, that was brilliant.
- Didn't have your seat belt on?

1055
01:33:04.237 --> 01:33:07.072
1 -L-20, show me code 6
at Olympic and Figueroa

1056
01:33:07.156 --> 01:33:08.782
on a TC with injuries.

1057
01:33:08.866 --> 01:33:12.536
- Copy your location.
- Sir, are you okay? What happened?

1058
01:33:13.913 --> 01:33:16.206
Sir, you were involved in an accident.

1059
01:33:16.291 --> 01:33:18.625
An ambulance is on its way to help you.

1060
01:33:18.710 --> 01:33:22.879
You understand what I'm saying to you?
Sit down and relax, okay?

1061
01:33:24.549 --> 01:33:28.385
Okay. Don't worry about the cab.
They'll get you a new one.

1062
01:33:30.138 --> 01:33:31.930
Relax and breathe.

1063
01:33:46.362 --> 01:33:47.738
Put your hands up.

1064
01:33:47.822 --> 01:33:51.116
Put your hands up. Face the cab.
Get down on your knees.

1065
01:33:51.200 --> 01:33:53.660
- Go ahead and arrest me.
- Put your hands on top of your head.

1066
01:33:53.745 --> 01:33:55.412
Take me to jail. L.A. County jail's great.

1067
01:33:55.496 --> 01:33:58.582
Don't move!
Put your hands behind your head.

1068
01:34:03.338 --> 01:34:06.673
1 -L-20, I need a backup
on a 187 suspect.

1069
01:34:19.812 --> 01:34:22.189
- Put your gun down!
- Get back! Put your hands down!

1070
01:34:22.273 --> 01:34:24.066
- Look, I gotta go.
- Put down the gun!

1071
01:34:24.150 --> 01:34:26.401
Stop moving! Stop moving!

1072
01:34:26.486 --> 01:34:28.820
When did this become a negotiation?

1073
01:34:31.032 --> 01:34:33.367
Clap your hands together.
Hold your hands together.

1074
01:34:33.451 --> 01:34:36.828
Listen, somebody's gonna get killed
if I don't go right now.

1075
01:34:36.913 --> 01:34:39.373
Now, cuff yourself.

1076
01:34:39.457 --> 01:34:42.417
I'm going to Sixth and Fig.
Call the cops.

1077
01:34:59.185 --> 01:35:03.230
- Give me that.
- Hey, hey! Whoa! Fuck!

1078
01:35:30.591 --> 01:35:31.925
Come on!

1079
01:36:01.456 --> 01:36:03.999
Come on. Go through.

1080
01:36:05.376 --> 01:36:08.295
Come on. Come on. Pick up.

1081
01:36:26.814 --> 01:36:28.148
Pick up.

1082
01:36:29.817 --> 01:36:31.401
Come on, girl.

1083
01:36:32.695 --> 01:36:33.820
Come on, pick up.

1084
01:36:57.887 --> 01:36:59.137
U.S. Attorney's Office.

1085
01:36:59.222 --> 01:37:00.472
- Annie!
- Yes.

1086
01:37:00.556 --> 01:37:04.434
It's Max. Max, the cab driver.
Listen to me, all right?

1087
01:37:04.519 --> 01:37:06.228
- A guy named Vincent...
- Max.

1088
01:37:06.312 --> 01:37:08.396
Listen to me, Annie.

1089
01:37:09.315 --> 01:37:12.526
- It's kind of a strange time to be calling.
- Listen. Listen, Annie.

1090
01:37:12.610 --> 01:37:16.154
There's a man named Vincent.
He's coming to kill you.

1091
01:37:16.989 --> 01:37:19.991
- He's what?
- Kill you! He's coming to kill you!

1092
01:37:20.076 --> 01:37:22.619
He was scoping out the building
when I dropped you off...

1093
01:37:22.703 --> 01:37:25.080
Okay, you know what?
Max, if this is supposed to be

1094
01:37:25.164 --> 01:37:27.123
some type ofjoke, it's not funny.

1095
01:37:27.208 --> 01:37:29.376
It's not a joke. Listen to me.
Annie, listen to me, please.

1096
01:37:29.460 --> 01:37:33.630
Felix hired him. Okay?
Or people that Felix worked for.

1097
01:37:33.714 --> 01:37:36.341
Felix Reyes-Torrena.
How do you know about my case?

1098
01:37:36.425 --> 01:37:38.134
I don't understand what's going on.

1099
01:37:38.219 --> 01:37:40.345
All I know is that
he's already killed witnesses.

1100
01:37:40.471 --> 01:37:42.556
He's coming to kill you.

1101
01:37:42.640 --> 01:37:44.641
When I dropped you off,
I don't know how it happened,

1102
01:37:44.725 --> 01:37:46.977
but he ended up in my cab.

1103
01:38:06.414 --> 01:38:07.664
Annie.

1104
01:38:08.165 --> 01:38:10.917
Annie, listen. All I want you to do...

1105
01:38:19.010 --> 01:38:21.303
- I don't understand what's going on.
- Annie, listen. Listen.

1106
01:38:21.387 --> 01:38:23.346
- Max.
- Please listen.

1107
01:38:44.619 --> 01:38:47.787
Get out of the building. Annie.

1108
01:38:51.751 --> 01:38:53.335
Okay, I'm leaving the building right now.

1109
01:38:53.419 --> 01:38:55.170
No, no, no, wait.

1110
01:38:55.254 --> 01:38:57.130
- Max.
- Wait, wait.

1111
01:38:59.216 --> 01:39:01.009
- Max.
- Listen, where are you right now?

1112
01:39:01.093 --> 01:39:02.844
- What floor?
- I'm on the sixteenth floor.

1113
01:39:02.928 --> 01:39:05.180
I'm in the law library and files.

1114
01:39:05.264 --> 01:39:07.641
He's two floors below you, corner office.

1115
01:39:07.725 --> 01:39:09.100
In my office?

1116
01:39:09.226 --> 01:39:10.644
Listen, he does not know
you're up there.

1117
01:39:10.728 --> 01:39:12.228
Just stay right there and call 911.

1118
01:39:12.313 --> 01:39:14.064
Max, are you sure
he's on the fourteenth floor?

1119
01:39:14.148 --> 01:39:18.234
Listen, just stay there and just call
the police. Just call the police.

1120
01:39:18.319 --> 01:39:19.486
Max?

1121
01:39:23.282 --> 01:39:24.449
Shit.

1122
01:39:31.248 --> 01:39:32.499
Max?

1123
01:39:38.964 --> 01:39:40.173
Shit.

1124
01:39:46.305 --> 01:39:49.724
- Max.
- Annie, he knows you're up there. Just...

1125
01:39:49.809 --> 01:39:51.184
I can't hear you. Hello?

1126
01:39:51.268 --> 01:39:53.436
Annie. Annie, listen to me.

1127
01:39:54.605 --> 01:39:55.855
Shit.

1128
01:39:58.317 --> 01:39:59.859
Annie. Annie!

1129
01:40:02.113 --> 01:40:03.279
Shit.

1130
01:40:59.712 --> 01:41:01.171
911. Operator.

1131
01:41:01.255 --> 01:41:04.007
Yes. Listen, there is a man
in my building, and he is...

1132
01:41:08.679 --> 01:41:09.888
Hello?

1133
01:44:19.036 --> 01:44:20.995
Let her go.

1134
01:44:21.080 --> 01:44:22.580
Max?

1135
01:44:25.000 --> 01:44:27.669
Why? What are you gonna do about it?

1136
01:44:31.340 --> 01:44:32.715
Come on.

1137
01:44:45.729 --> 01:44:46.896
Max!

1138
01:45:06.750 --> 01:45:10.878
- Oh, God. Felix Reyes-Torrena?
- Yeah. I met him.

1139
01:45:10.963 --> 01:45:12.880
What do you mean, you met him? How?

1140
01:45:12.965 --> 01:45:16.467
I don't know. Look, when I
dropped you off, there was a fare.

1141
01:45:16.593 --> 01:45:19.387
- He said his name is Vincent.
- Vincent?

1142
01:45:25.561 --> 01:45:28.646
- Wait, wait, wait, wait.
- This is the street.

1143
01:45:29.773 --> 01:45:31.566
This way. Come on.

1144
01:46:00.471 --> 01:46:02.305
Stay up. Stay up. Stay up.

1145
01:46:02.431 --> 01:46:05.516
- What we gonna do?
- Wait, wait, wait. Wait.

1146
01:46:05.642 --> 01:46:07.351
No, no. This way.

1147
01:46:30.334 --> 01:46:32.335
Wait, wait. Wait. Wait.

1148
01:46:56.026 --> 01:46:57.360
Stay down.

1149
01:47:45.576 --> 01:47:46.742
Shit.

1150
01:47:54.751 --> 01:47:56.460
There's a station.

1151
01:48:37.336 --> 01:48:38.586
Shit.

1152
01:49:13.664 --> 01:49:14.956
Max!

1153
01:49:17.000 --> 01:49:19.043
I do this for a living!

1154
01:50:30.073 --> 01:50:33.743
We're almost at the next stop.

1155
01:50:36.580 --> 01:50:37.913
Hey, Max.

1156
01:50:41.877 --> 01:50:45.588
A guy gets on the MTA here in L.A.
and dies.

1157
01:50:50.761 --> 01:50:52.928
Think anybody will notice?
